 "section_summary": "This section consists chiefly of SCAP radio-station registers, completing the geographical listings for Miyagi, Fukushima, and Hokkaido and then listing Japan’s international transmitting stations. It also contains a geographical list of Allied Forces Radio Service broadcasters and the opening portion of an extensive frequency-ordered index of Japanese stations. The tables record frequencies, call signs, power, emission class, service type, operating limitations, station locations, and, in some cases, coordinates and international circuits.",
